{"ref":"BDB, אַף","hw":"אַף","html":"I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַף</span></big><sub>277</sub>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:2\" href=\"/Genesis.30.2\">Gn 30:2</a> nostril, nose, face, anger <strong>(</strong>Assyrian <em>appu</em>, <em>face</em> Flood<sup>iii. 27, 29</sup> cf. Hpt KAT<sup>2Gloss</sup>, Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">أَنْفٌ</span>, Ethiopic አንፍ <em>nose;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܰܦܶܐ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַנְפִּין</span> <em>face</em><strong>)</strong>—abs. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:21\" href=\"/Psalms.78.21\">ψ 78:21</a> +; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:45\" href=\"/Genesis.27.45\">Gn 27:45</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַפִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:23\" href=\"/Exodus.22.23\">Ex 22:23</a> +, etc.; du. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַפַּיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.17\">Pr 14:17</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">אַפָּיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:7\" href=\"/Genesis.2.7\">Gn 2:7</a> + etc.;—In Hex JE (<a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:1\" href=\"/Joshua.7.1\">Jos 7:1</a> P? <a data-ref=\"Joshua 23:16\" href=\"/Joshua.23.16\">23:16</a> D?).<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>nostril</em>, as organ of breathing <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:7\" href=\"/Genesis.2.7\">Gn 2:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:22\" href=\"/Genesis.7.22\">7:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 27:3\" href=\"/Job.27.3\">Jb 27:3</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:20\" href=\"/Numbers.11.20\">Nu 11:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.9\">2 S 22:9</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:9\" href=\"/Psalms.18.9\">ψ 18:9</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 65:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.65.5\">Is 65:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.22\">Is 2:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:20\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.20\">La 4:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.18\">Ez 38:18</a> (del. Co) <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:10\" href=\"/Amos.4.10\">Am 4:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּחַ אַפֶּיךָ</span> (of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>) i.e. wind <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:8\" href=\"/Exodus.15.8\">Ex 15:8</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִשְׁמַת רוּחַ אַפּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.16\">2 S 22:16</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:16\" href=\"/Psalms.18.16\">ψ 18:16</a> (vid. also sub <strong>3</strong>); <em>nose</em> sg. <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 7:5\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.7.5\">Ct 7:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 7:9\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.7.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.17\">Ez 8:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.25\">23:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:33\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.33\">Pr 30:33</a> (where play upon diff. meaning of <span dir=\"rtl\">אַף</span> & <span dir=\"rtl\">אַפַּיִם</span>): (<em>a</em>) as organ of smelling <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.10\">Dt 33:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 115:6\" href=\"/Psalms.115.6\">ψ 115:6</a>; (<em>b</em>) as place of ring for ornament <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:47\" href=\"/Genesis.24.47\">Gn 24:47</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.21\">Is 3:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.12\">Ez 16:12</a>; (<em>c</em>) as place of ring or hook for captive <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:28\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.28\">2 K 19:28</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:29\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.29\">Is 37:29</a>; for beasts, e.g. swine <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.22\">Pr 11:22</a>; hippopot. <a data-ref=\"Job 40:24\" href=\"/Job.40.24\">Jb 40:24</a>; crocod. v <a data-ref=\"Job 40:26\" href=\"/Job.40.26\">26</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  Du <em>face</em> (especially in phrase <span dir=\"rtl\">אַפַּיִם אַרְצָה</span>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:1\" href=\"/Genesis.19.1\">Gn 19:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:6\" href=\"/Genesis.42.6\">42:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 48:12\" href=\"/Genesis.48.12\">48:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:31\" href=\"/Numbers.22.31\">Nu 22:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:41\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.41\">1 S 20:41</a>; <a da